      "description": "<p>When you acquire this Heroic Skill and whenever you rest, you may choose one wellspring: <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-id=\"imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-type=\"Item\">Air</a>, <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.ZyOMe6IkUTlBzfjw\" data-id=\"ZyOMe6IkUTlBzfjw\" data-type=\"Item\">Earth</a>, <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.0sFCVCoM6FRrQP2f\" data-id=\"0sFCVCoM6FRrQP2f\" data-type=\"Item\">Fire</a>, <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.5XAuMMbDPlLzhJLw\" data-id=\"5XAuMMbDPlLzhJLw\" data-type=\"Item\">Bolt</a>, or <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.Osq3NN3QCtiW7otU\" data-id=\"Osq3NN3QCtiW7otU\" data-type=\"Item\">Ice</a>. If you do, you gain the following benefits until your next rest:</p><ul><li>You always treat the chosen <strong>wellspring</strong> as being available during each scene, in addition to whatever wellsprings are already available.</li><li>You may perform Rituals of the <strong>Elementalism</strong> discipline, but only if those Rituals manipulate the element of the chosen <strong>wellspring</strong>.</li><li>You gain <strong>Resistance</strong> to the damage type corresponding to the chosen <strong>wellspring</strong>.</li><li>When you deal damage, you may change its type to the one corresponding to the chosen <strong>wellspring</strong>. If you do, that damage ignores Resistances.</li></ul>",
